Action: hold open until N01's schema v2 is accepted, then close as superseded by N03/N04 (or fold any field this issue covers that N03/N04 miss into N04). Don't build this in parallel — it would re-decide the same one-way-door schema.","createdAt":"2026-06-15T13:28:40.636Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-15T13:28:40.577Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"720d0535-dfc6-465f-8111-d1a3e6eab786","name":"Anton Babushkin"}}

